Ryujinx shader translator: honour Maxwell's FMZ mode on FMUL/FFMA (FP32). Ryujinx decodes the Fmz field and
ignores it, so 0 * Inf/NaN gave NaN where the hardware gives 0 (FFMA: c). See docs/nvn/DEBUG.md #49.
Applied at build time by translator/Ryujinx.Graphics.Shader.csproj to a copy in private/build; the
checkout in private/third_party stays untouched. The Ryujinx code in the context lines is MIT.
